WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome to the Donor Management System.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
The main menu offers donor registration, blood donation, and blood requests.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
First, choose "Register Donor" to create a donor profile.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Enter the donor's first name and last name.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Next, provide the donor's age and blood group.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Enter a phone number to complete the registration details.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
The donor information is submitted and the registration process is completed.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The system returns to the main menu. Select "Donate blood" to record a donation.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Enter the donor ID to identify the registered donor.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Provide the donation date in the requested date format.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:02.000
The system confirms that the blood donation has been recorded successfully.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Return to the menu and choose "Request blood" to search for a compatible donor.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Enter the required blood group.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:21.200
The system checks the donor records and displays a compatible donor, if available.